        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I'm planning on running the Starter Kit for two of my friends, but I have trepidations about action economy issues - most TTRPG games and scenarios are written for around four people, and half that usually requires adjustments.&nbsp; Has anybody tried the starter kit with small numbers of players, and if so, how does it generally go?</p>",
